Description: DistroClone Backup & Restore Tool
 Incremental rootfs backup and restore tool for Debian-based systems.
 Companion tool for DistroClone.
 .
 v1.3 — Native snapper integration on btrfs cache filesystems.
 Versioning of the rsync cache is managed via a dedicated snapper
 config ("distroclone-backup"). On non-btrfs filesystems falls back
 to plain rsync without versioning (no regression on ext4/xfs).
 Without snapper installed, behaves as v1.2.2 (raw btrfs snapshots).
